==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Squawkabilly}} in its {{form|Squawkabilly|Green Plumage}} form.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Squawkabilly|162}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*{{m|Quick Attack}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Squawkabilly}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

